{"suttaId":"tha-ap92","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4916,4939],"vripara":"51"},"segments":{"tha-ap92:0.3":"Padumapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap92:1.1":"“Pokkharavanaṃ paviṭṭho, bhañjanto padumānihaṃ;","tha-ap92:1.3":"Tatthaddasaṃ phussaṃ buddhaṃ [addasaṃ phussasambuddhaṃ (sī. syā.)], bāttiṃsavaralakkhaṇaṃ.","tha-ap92:2.1":"“Padumapupphaṃ gahetvāna, ākāse ukkhipiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap92:2.3":"Pāpakammaṃ saritvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","tha-ap92:3.1":"“Pabbajitvāna kāyena, manasā saṃvutena ca;","tha-ap92:3.3":"Vacīduccaritaṃ hitvā, ājīvaṃ parisodhayiṃ.","tha-ap92:4.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap92:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap92:5.1":"“Padumābhāsanāmā ca, aṭṭhārasa mahīpatī;","tha-ap92:5.3":"Aṭṭhārasesu kappesu, aṭṭhatālīsamāsisuṃ.","tha-ap92:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap92:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā padumapupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap92:8.1":"Padumapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap92:9.1":"Timiravaggo navamo.","tha-ap92:10.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap92:11.1":"Timiranaṅgalīpuppha, nippannañjaliko adho;","tha-ap92:11.3":"Dve raṃsisaññī phalado, saddasaññī ca secako;","tha-ap92:11.5":"Padmapupphī ca gāthāyo, chappaññāsa pakittitā."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2750,"to":2750,"paras":[{"para":2750,"vripara":"51","refs":["tha-ap92:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>pokkharavanaṃ paviṭṭho</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha pakārena naḷadaṇḍapattādīhi kharantīti pokkharā, pokkharānaṃ samuṭṭhitaṭṭhena samūhanti pokkharavanaṃ, padumagacchasaṇḍehi maṇḍitaṃ majjhaṃ paviṭṭho ahanti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap92:1"],["tha-ap92:1"],["tha-ap92:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap92:1.1","pokkharavanaṃ paviṭṭho",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
